  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1307.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1307.01 Purpose. The purpose of the rules in this part is to accommodate situations in which strict compliance with all requirements established by this chapter may not be in the best interests of the public or the DWGTF.\n\nSource. #12903, eff 10-23-19",
